{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.juri.photo",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她把旧照片摊在桌上",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.juri.photo",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.juri.photo",
    "idolId": "juri",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "唔，都是姿势不太行吗？不，表情也是……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你还是一样的好学啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……只是有点时间，在确认而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "你看这个，这时候表情很僵吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，能这么觉得，正是樹里成长的证明。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "算、算是吧。总归是会成长一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "我也以自己的方式努力过了……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是啊。刚认识的时候真让人怀念。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……想起来，那时候挺乱来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "那时候……作为偶像也还差得远，还老是跟你顶。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "现在都成了好回忆了。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……那个，抱歉了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？为什么突然道歉？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "不是……虽然是以前的事，但态度不好。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我没在意啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "我在意啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……也许是借口，但除了家人，我很少跟男的有接触。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "对偶像这件事有不安也是真的，和你也不知道该怎么相处……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……原来如此。但现在，能像这样普通地说话了。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这也是作为偶像和制作人建立起信赖关系的结果吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "那也有……但不只是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "所以说……我的、那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "想让你全部知道——",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……够了！还是算了！现在不说！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么啊，说到那个份上会让人在意的吧。喂，你想说什么？告诉我吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "也、就是说……制作人对我的理解还完全不够！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "而且想知道刚才的答案的话……今后就继续制作我！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……哇啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了樹里？",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "等、……别突然过来啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，不是之前拍的宣材写真吗。摊在桌上，在确认什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……在学姿势。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "衣装也是，不过偶像果然姿势也得有样子吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "所以我在看之前拍的照片学习，不过……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……有点害羞起来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
